    "burrow drew the hidden root circle on his map before adding the new crossing below it. this time, his straight line reached fern's garden exactly": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/burrow-drew-the-hidden-root-circle-on-his-map-before-adding-the-new-crossing-below-it-this-time-his-straight-line-reached-fern-s-garden-exactly-df8d773beb.mp3",
    "burrow dug beneath the clearing and followed the straight route on his map. the soil stayed firm and easy at first. then his shovel struck something hard": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/burrow-dug-beneath-the-clearing-and-followed-the-straight-route-on-his-map-the-soil-stayed-firm-and-easy-at-first-then-his-shovel-struck-something-hard-4311de5c6f.mp3",
    "burrow dug carefully around the wooden edge instead of striking it again. soon, a small hidden underground door appeared between hollow oak's thick roots": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/burrow-dug-carefully-around-the-wooden-edge-instead-of-striking-it-again-soon-a-small-hidden-underground-door-appeared-between-hollow-oak-s-thick-roots-e88afa23dc.mp3",
    "burrow dug carefully beneath the floor while pip followed the trembling root. soon they uncovered a buried branch tugging a second rope. that rope led upward": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/burrow-dug-carefully-beneath-the-floor-while-pip-followed-the-trembling-root-soon-they-uncovered-a-buried-branch-tugging-a-second-rope-that-rope-led-upward-25437e0634.mp3",
    "burrow gathered his friends around hollow oak's table and showed them a sketch of the hidden door. together, they planned how to inspect it safely": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/burrow-gathered-his-friends-around-hollow-oak-s-table-and-showed-them-a-sketch-of-the-hidden-door-together-they-planned-how-to-inspect-it-safely-8907f4efdd.mp3",
    "burrow looked up at hollow oak's real roots and compared them with the carving. he found the root pointing north and pressed its matching mark": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/burrow-looked-up-at-hollow-oak-s-real-roots-and-compared-them-with-the-carving-he-found-the-root-pointing-north-and-pressed-its-matching-mark-850bcc751c.mp3",
