    "burrow popped out of a nearby tunnel and peered closely at pip's new discovery. \"old stories call that a bravery stone,\" the mole explained": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/burrow-popped-out-of-a-nearby-tunnel-and-peered-closely-at-pip-s-new-discovery-old-stories-call-that-a-bravery-stone-the-mole-explained-b25010cd26.mp3",
