    "burrow sniffed along the moss until his nose stopped at one thick patch. hidden behind it was a root door so tiny that pip could not enter": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/burrow-sniffed-along-the-moss-until-his-nose-stopped-at-one-thick-patch-hidden-behind-it-was-a-root-door-so-tiny-that-pip-could-not-enter-58850a9163.mp3",
    "burrow sniffed the soil and found a familiar smell beneath the roots. he uncovered a narrow underground path. the creature stepped forward. \"here,\" it said": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/burrow-sniffed-the-soil-and-found-a-familiar-smell-beneath-the-roots-he-uncovered-a-narrow-underground-path-the-creature-stepped-forward-here-it-said-2bd29ec3db.mp3",
    "burrow stared at the shining picture. 'have you been here before?' he asked. luna touched the stone gently, as if greeting a friend she remembered": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/burrow-stared-at-the-shining-picture-have-you-been-here-before-he-asked-luna-touched-the-stone-gently-as-if-greeting-a-friend-she-remembered-246fa0d92c.mp3",
    "burrow studied each picture and tried to find where the story began. no carving had words or numbers, so their order remained a complete mystery": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/burrow-studied-each-picture-and-tried-to-find-where-the-story-began-no-carving-had-words-or-numbers-so-their-order-remained-a-complete-mystery-ddf80a63e5.mp3",
    "burrow turned the plain stone over and reminded pip what happened. the stone did not climb the wall or follow the marsh markers; pip did": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/burrow-turned-the-plain-stone-over-and-reminded-pip-what-happened-the-stone-did-not-climb-the-wall-or-follow-the-marsh-markers-pip-did-e287a27a83.mp3",
    "but it did not begin with wings. a monarch has four life stages": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/but-it-did-not-begin-with-wings-a-monarch-has-four-life-stages-9dee8e00e1.mp3",
