    "farm animals make many sounds": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/farm-animals-make-many-sounds-34f734a501.mp3",
    "farther upstream, ancient roots spread wider across the banks and under the water. the friends followed them while the last faint stream note disappeared": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/farther-upstream-ancient-roots-spread-wider-across-the-banks-and-under-the-water-the-friends-followed-them-while-the-last-faint-stream-note-disappeared-33e704974c.mp3",
    "fern and dewdrop followed the narrowing stream toward its oldest source. with every bend, the water grew quieter and the forest became more still": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/fern-and-dewdrop-followed-the-narrowing-stream-toward-its-oldest-source-with-every-bend-the-water-grew-quieter-and-the-forest-became-more-still-663a64fff6.mp3",
    "fern and dewdrop rested beside the flowing water and listened to the music they had restored together. the stream carried their laughter down through moonwood": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/fern-and-dewdrop-rested-beside-the-flowing-water-and-listened-to-the-music-they-had-restored-together-the-stream-carried-their-laughter-down-through-moonwood-07d8728539.mp3",
    "fern braced both feet and pushed the boulder with her hands. the pressure only sank it deeper, allowing the wet mud to grip even tighter": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/fern-braced-both-feet-and-pushed-the-boulder-with-her-hands-the-pressure-only-sank-it-deeper-allowing-the-wet-mud-to-grip-even-tighter-2fa2b054cc.mp3",
    "fern checked both tunnel entrances and planted soft moss around their edges. the moss held the soil neatly in place. now the short garden route was ready": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/fern-checked-both-tunnel-entrances-and-planted-soft-moss-around-their-edges-the-moss-held-the-soil-neatly-in-place-now-the-short-garden-route-was-ready-5634bd18da.mp3",
    "fern checked the shaded garden while burrow checked the cool tunnels. neither place held the silver box. luna crossed both places off her list": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/fern-checked-the-shaded-garden-while-burrow-checked-the-cool-tunnels-neither-place-held-the-silver-box-luna-crossed-both-places-off-her-list-4562743a07.mp3",
    "fern cupped one glassleaf bud as the moon rose over her garden. the bud needed moonlight before it closed, but old branches shaded the flower bed": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/fern-cupped-one-glassleaf-bud-as-the-moon-rose-over-her-garden-the-bud-needed-moonlight-before-it-closed-but-old-branches-shaded-the-flower-bed-1290f699f0.mp3",
