    "fern folded her wings, squeezed through the narrow doorway, and called back. 'there is a whole room inside, and someone is searching through a very large collection!'": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/fern-folded-her-wings-squeezed-through-the-narrow-doorway-and-called-back-there-is-a-whole-room-inside-and-someone-is-searching-through-a-very-large-collection-951e7aac70.mp3",
    "fern gave one final tap, making three slow taps in all. the root followed the three vibrations around the wooden frame. soon the front step was clear": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/fern-gave-one-final-tap-making-three-slow-taps-in-all-the-root-followed-the-three-vibrations-around-the-wooden-frame-soon-the-front-step-was-clear-3263f9e05b.mp3",
    "fern leaned through the tiny doorway and called to the others. 'twig found her spectacles, and she would like some visitors!' the friends cheered from outside": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/fern-leaned-through-the-tiny-doorway-and-called-to-the-others-twig-found-her-spectacles-and-she-would-like-some-visitors-the-friends-cheered-from-outside-5ea0461242.mp3",
    "fern looked around, then noticed the spectacles resting on twig's head. 'they are above your ears,' she said gently. twig reached up and laughed": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/fern-looked-around-then-noticed-the-spectacles-resting-on-twig-s-head-they-are-above-your-ears-she-said-gently-twig-reached-up-and-laughed-e1afdfc22c.mp3",
    "fern looped a strong green vine around the boulder and pulled from the bank. at the same time, dewdrop sent a steady current underneath it": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/fern-looped-a-strong-green-vine-around-the-boulder-and-pulled-from-the-bank-at-the-same-time-dewdrop-sent-a-steady-current-underneath-it-e799078c67.mp3",
    "fern lowered one finger toward the waiting buds. \"just this much,\" she said. stone tipped the wet rock slowly until the beam followed her hand": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/fern-lowered-one-finger-toward-the-waiting-buds-just-this-much-she-said-stone-tipped-the-wet-rock-slowly-until-the-beam-followed-her-hand-9588fc09cd.mp3",
    "fern opened the recipe and pointed to a warning. the finished growing potion should be green, but the mixture inside wren's cauldron shone bright purple": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/fern-opened-the-recipe-and-pointed-to-a-warning-the-finished-growing-potion-should-be-green-but-the-mixture-inside-wren-s-cauldron-shone-bright-purple-6cb7af9db0.mp3",
    "fern packed strong woven root fiber into every part of the curved mold. spark pressed the material down carefully. then they left it beside the warm lanterns": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/fern-packed-strong-woven-root-fiber-into-every-part-of-the-curved-mold-spark-pressed-the-material-down-carefully-then-they-left-it-beside-the-warm-lanterns-7c80ab05e2.mp3",
    "fern paused beside crystal stream because its familiar music had vanished. the water still flowed between the banks, but none of the singing stones made a sound": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/fern-paused-beside-crystal-stream-because-its-familiar-music-had-vanished-the-water-still-flowed-between-the-banks-but-none-of-the-singing-stones-made-a-sound-3937833c48.mp3",
    "fern planted one small seed in the soft ground beside hollow oak. as she patted down the soil, she hummed the beginning of its growth song": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/fern-planted-one-small-seed-in-the-soft-ground-beside-hollow-oak-as-she-patted-down-the-soil-she-hummed-the-beginning-of-its-growth-song-4cadfc575d.mp3",
    "fern sang one calm note and waited for the root to relax. instead, the root copied her sound by curling into one new loop. fern stared": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/fern-sang-one-calm-note-and-waited-for-the-root-to-relax-instead-the-root-copied-her-sound-by-curling-into-one-new-loop-fern-stared-9efbe845a6.mp3",
    "fern saw the dangerous glow and pointed spark away from crystal stream. she brought a soft cloth, but the trapped sneeze was already too powerful": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/fern-saw-the-dangerous-glow-and-pointed-spark-away-from-crystal-stream-she-brought-a-soft-cloth-but-the-trapped-sneeze-was-already-too-powerful-0291d1558f.mp3",
    "fern stood in the center of the clearing and sang the slow root-song. each plant stopped marching, turned toward her voice, and waited for the next step": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/fern-stood-in-the-center-of-the-clearing-and-sang-the-slow-root-song-each-plant-stopped-marching-turned-toward-her-voice-and-waited-for-the-next-step-6dd19c799f.mp3",
    "fern stopped casting spells and listened to the green leaves rustling around her. they repeated the opening notes, then paused where her song ended": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/fern-stopped-casting-spells-and-listened-to-the-green-leaves-rustling-around-her-they-repeated-the-opening-notes-then-paused-where-her-song-ended-d142e0ad8d.mp3",
