    "fern tried a slower verse, then a careful stopping spell, but neither one completed the song. the wild plant twisted higher and grew even faster": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/fern-tried-a-slower-verse-then-a-careful-stopping-spell-but-neither-one-completed-the-song-the-wild-plant-twisted-higher-and-grew-even-faster-c1949bc259.mp3",
    "fern tried three more soft notes, hoping a longer song would help. the silver root answered with three tight loops. they wrapped around the wooden rail": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/fern-tried-three-more-soft-notes-hoping-a-longer-song-would-help-the-silver-root-answered-with-three-tight-loops-they-wrapped-around-the-wooden-rail-3c1a9eeb8f.mp3",
    "fern waited until the root became still again. then she tapped once more near the frame. the root followed that single vibration without making extra loops": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/fern-waited-until-the-root-became-still-again-then-she-tapped-once-more-near-the-frame-the-root-followed-that-single-vibration-without-making-extra-loops-353e977bc8.mp3",
