    "flint checked each present landmark and followed the changing route through one long loop. near sunset, the new marks finally led him back to hollow oak": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/flint-checked-each-present-landmark-and-followed-the-changing-route-through-one-long-loop-near-sunset-the-new-marks-finally-led-him-back-to-hollow-oak-f636f07fe1.mp3",
    "flint chose the darker shadow and followed it beside the known path. after only a few steps, he walked straight into a thick fern wall. the shadow had misled him": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/flint-chose-the-darker-shadow-and-followed-it-beside-the-known-path-after-only-a-few-steps-he-walked-straight-into-a-thick-fern-wall-the-shadow-had-misled-him-cda3d3c31f.mp3",
    "flint covered one glass panel with his gloved hand. he expected one shadow to vanish, but both remained. the problem was not inside that panel": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/flint-covered-one-glass-panel-with-his-gloved-hand-he-expected-one-shadow-to-vanish-but-both-remained-the-problem-was-not-inside-that-panel-495565bc1e.mp3",
    "flint hurried ahead and made two confident left turns. instead of finding the stream, he reached the gray edge of fog marsh and finally checked his map": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/flint-hurried-ahead-and-made-two-confident-left-turns-instead-of-finding-the-stream-he-reached-the-gray-edge-of-fog-marsh-and-finally-checked-his-map-e1350c5a6b.mp3",
    "flint left hollow oak with fresh parchment, a sharp quill, and an enormous plan. he intended to draw every path in moonwood exactly where it belonged": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/flint-left-hollow-oak-with-fresh-parchment-a-sharp-quill-and-an-enormous-plan-he-intended-to-draw-every-path-in-moonwood-exactly-where-it-belonged-1e7a16d713.mp3",
    "flint lifted the lantern and frowned at the ground. every root cast two shadows in different directions. a guide light should show one clear way around each root": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/flint-lifted-the-lantern-and-frowned-at-the-ground-every-root-cast-two-shadows-in-different-directions-a-guide-light-should-show-one-clear-way-around-each-root-798166f4ed.mp3",
    "flint lifted the lantern low and tested every nearby root again. each root now cast one clear shadow away from the path. the guide light worked properly": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/flint-lifted-the-lantern-low-and-tested-every-nearby-root-again-each-root-now-cast-one-clear-shadow-away-from-the-path-the-guide-light-worked-properly-85f0008147.mp3",
    "flint lowered the map and looked at the forest around him. the nearby trees stood in different places from the ones in his careful drawing": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/flint-lowered-the-map-and-looked-at-the-forest-around-him-the-nearby-trees-stood-in-different-places-from-the-ones-in-his-careful-drawing-018247fde0.mp3",
    "flint picked up the crystal and wrapped it inside his brown explorer pouch. he fastened the pouch tightly. this time, no crystal could slip back into the light": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/flint-picked-up-the-crystal-and-wrapped-it-inside-his-brown-explorer-pouch-he-fastened-the-pouch-tightly-this-time-no-crystal-could-slip-back-into-the-light-645c916095.mp3",
