    "pip asked how fern stopped the plant, so she sang the missing final notes. the quiet leaves rustled the whole finished song back to them": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/pip-asked-how-fern-stopped-the-plant-so-she-sang-the-missing-final-notes-the-quiet-leaves-rustled-the-whole-finished-song-back-to-them-ed52e304ce.mp3",
    "pip asked luna to remember one more helpful detail. she pictured bright pebbles shifting beneath very cold water. one pebble was striped silver": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/pip-asked-luna-to-remember-one-more-helpful-detail-she-pictured-bright-pebbles-shifting-beneath-very-cold-water-one-pebble-was-striped-silver-dc8f8b0dd2.mp3",
    "pip asked why the little toadling was making such a giant call. it explained that it was lost and had been calling for its family": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/pip-asked-why-the-little-toadling-was-making-such-a-giant-call-it-explained-that-it-was-lost-and-had-been-calling-for-its-family-21e26b7cd7.mp3",
    "pip brought the creature inside hollow oak, where the others had woken. stone placed an acorn biscuit nearby. everyone stayed back while the creature ate": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/pip-brought-the-creature-inside-hollow-oak-where-the-others-had-woken-stone-placed-an-acorn-biscuit-nearby-everyone-stayed-back-while-the-creature-ate-fd07eb87f1.mp3",
    "pip called the warm breath real, useful progress, but glimmer lowered their head. \"warmth is useful,\" glimmer said, \"but i still want a flame.\"": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/pip-called-the-warm-breath-real-useful-progress-but-glimmer-lowered-their-head-warmth-is-useful-glimmer-said-but-i-still-want-a-flame-d47255ebe0.mp3",
    "pip caught one fragment before it rolled into a dark bush. a tiny star pattern glowed across its smooth, warm golden surface": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/pip-caught-one-fragment-before-it-rolled-into-a-dark-bush-a-tiny-star-pattern-glowed-across-its-smooth-warm-golden-surface-aa009f608d.mp3",
