    "pip examined the lantern instead of the path. beneath its handle, he spotted one bright crystal at an odd angle. \"that should not be there,\" he said": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/pip-examined-the-lantern-instead-of-the-path-beneath-its-handle-he-spotted-one-bright-crystal-at-an-odd-angle-that-should-not-be-there-he-said-834bac9eb0.mp3",
    "pip grabbed the rope with both hands and tried to hold it still. instead, the bell swung harder above him. the lanterns shook even more": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/pip-grabbed-the-rope-with-both-hands-and-tried-to-hold-it-still-instead-the-bell-swung-harder-above-him-the-lanterns-shook-even-more-d6ab0bced4.mp3",
    "pip greeted flint at the doorway and asked whether his map worked. flint showed both pages and answered, \"the map i dated today did.\"": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/pip-greeted-flint-at-the-doorway-and-asked-whether-his-map-worked-flint-showed-both-pages-and-answered-the-map-i-dated-today-did-904f9c9d7a.mp3",
    "pip held the stone close and waited for a rush of courage. he still felt like himself, and the steep cliffs still seemed frightening": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/pip-held-the-stone-close-and-waited-for-a-rush-of-courage-he-still-felt-like-himself-and-the-steep-cliffs-still-seemed-frightening-cbb35504dd.mp3",
    "pip hurried to burrow and opened his hands around the dull stone. \"did it run out of brave?\" he asked, remembering the long, dark marsh": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/pip-hurried-to-burrow-and-opened-his-hands-around-the-dull-stone-did-it-run-out-of-brave-he-asked-remembering-the-long-dark-marsh-3c065bdd37.mp3",
    "pip knelt between the old roots and lifted the glowing stone carefully. golden light warmed his fingers, and he wondered what kind of stone it could be": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/pip-knelt-between-the-old-roots-and-lifted-the-glowing-stone-carefully-golden-light-warmed-his-fingers-and-he-wondered-what-kind-of-stone-it-could-be-ea1dd68ab3.mp3",
    "pip knelt down and held completely still, speaking only in a soft voice. the creature watched him, then chose to step closer. one step, then another": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/pip-knelt-down-and-held-completely-still-speaking-only-in-a-soft-voice-the-creature-watched-him-then-chose-to-step-closer-one-step-then-another-8a3061e1ba.mp3",
    "pip laid out an acorn, a leaf stem, a smooth stone, and his own fingertip. he tested each touch on a different chime. stone listened closely": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/pip-laid-out-an-acorn-a-leaf-stem-a-smooth-stone-and-his-own-fingertip-he-tested-each-touch-on-a-different-chime-stone-listened-closely-b1cbb1c2ea.mp3",
    "pip lifted one fragment above his head. the trees hid its constellation, so its glow faded and it settled back into his hands": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/pip-lifted-one-fragment-above-his-head-the-trees-hid-its-constellation-so-its-glow-faded-and-it-settled-back-into-his-hands-d7cf958d92.mp3",
    "pip needed something stronger than the loose wedge. he looped the lower rope around a smooth root peg. burrow watched while pip pulled the knot tight": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/pip-needed-something-stronger-than-the-loose-wedge-he-looped-the-lower-rope-around-a-smooth-root-peg-burrow-watched-while-pip-pulled-the-knot-tight-30d43c7e91.mp3",
    "pip noticed a silver patch shining beneath the roots on the garden's far side. \"that light comes from the stream!\" he called. stone turned to look": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/pip-noticed-a-silver-patch-shining-beneath-the-roots-on-the-garden-s-far-side-that-light-comes-from-the-stream-he-called-stone-turned-to-look-2cff43081d.mp3",
    "pip opened the door and saw a small creature at the clearing's edge. its enormous silver eyes shone in the dark. it trembled but did not run": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/pip-opened-the-door-and-saw-a-small-creature-at-the-clearing-s-edge-its-enormous-silver-eyes-shone-in-the-dark-it-trembled-but-did-not-run-4df3f3f56a.mp3",
    "pip placed each matching object beneath its chime so they would remember the pattern. stone checked every pair. then they stood ready to play together": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/pip-placed-each-matching-object-beneath-its-chime-so-they-would-remember-the-pattern-stone-checked-every-pair-then-they-stood-ready-to-play-together-cbb74309f3.mp3",
