    "pip quickly returned to stone and pulled hard on each thick rope. \"the ropes are strong,\" he said, but stone's worry did not disappear": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/pip-quickly-returned-to-stone-and-pulled-hard-on-each-thick-rope-the-ropes-are-strong-he-said-but-stone-s-worry-did-not-disappear-e3091eea1a.mp3",
