    "spark apologized to the field of blue flowers and lowered his wand. before he could plan a repair, another strong tickle started inside his nose": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/spark-apologized-to-the-field-of-blue-flowers-and-lowered-his-wand-before-he-could-plan-a-repair-another-strong-tickle-started-inside-his-nose-6eab8dd45f.mp3",
    "spark began by covering three boards with arrows, numbers, and tiny flames. he explained each mark carefully, but glimmer's eyes grew wider as the lesson grew harder": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/spark-began-by-covering-three-boards-with-arrows-numbers-and-tiny-flames-he-explained-each-mark-carefully-but-glimmer-s-eyes-grew-wider-as-the-lesson-grew-harder-4dc7270757.mp3",
    "spark carefully dropped his wand so no more magic could escape through it. \"please count every nearby changed fish with me,\" he asked dewdrop": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/spark-carefully-dropped-his-wand-so-no-more-magic-could-escape-through-it-please-count-every-nearby-changed-fish-with-me-he-asked-dewdrop-273fcd5eff.mp3",
    "spark cast the copy spell again, hoping the second hook might last longer. he counted without hanging the lantern. at ten, that hook vanished too": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/spark-cast-the-copy-spell-again-hoping-the-second-hook-might-last-longer-he-counted-without-hanging-the-lantern-at-ten-that-hook-vanished-too-6e4ee2fcbd.mp3",
    "spark copied glimmer's pose and waved his arms with great care. golden sparkles lifted his hat, but both boots stayed firmly on the ground. 'almost,' spark said": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/spark-copied-glimmer-s-pose-and-waved-his-arms-with-great-care-golden-sparkles-lifted-his-hat-but-both-boots-stayed-firmly-on-the-ground-almost-spark-said-031fd4aae5.mp3",
    "spark counted their repeatable successes: one floating boot, five gliding steps, and one warm breath. glimmer tapped one claw against spark's hand. they had kept their deal": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/spark-counted-their-repeatable-successes-one-floating-boot-five-gliding-steps-and-one-warm-breath-glimmer-tapped-one-claw-against-spark-s-hand-they-had-kept-their-deal-93079557a6.mp3",
    "spark hung the lantern on the new root-fiber hook, then counted aloud. \"ten, eleven, twelve!\" the hook remained solid, even after the last gold dot faded": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/spark-hung-the-lantern-on-the-new-root-fiber-hook-then-counted-aloud-ten-eleven-twelve-the-hook-remained-solid-even-after-the-last-gold-dot-faded-17c5d2be15.mp3",
    "spark hung the waiting lantern from the glowing copied hook and began to count. for nine counts, the hook held firmly. luna watched from below": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/spark-hung-the-waiting-lantern-from-the-glowing-copied-hook-and-began-to-count-for-nine-counts-the-hook-held-firmly-luna-watched-from-below-93face3586.mp3",
    "spark lowered his wand, stopped waving, and slowly raised one boot. for one steady second it floated above the grass. both friends stared, then cheered at the same time": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/spark-lowered-his-wand-stopped-waving-and-slowly-raised-one-boot-for-one-steady-second-it-floated-above-the-grass-both-friends-stared-then-cheered-at-the-same-time-0af0857a1e.mp3",
    "spark offered glimmer fire lessons if they helped test his floating spell. glimmer liked the trade, so they placed one claw in spark's hand and sealed the deal": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/spark-offered-glimmer-fire-lessons-if-they-helped-test-his-floating-spell-glimmer-liked-the-trade-so-they-placed-one-claw-in-spark-s-hand-and-sealed-the-deal-78cd853e9a.mp3",
    "spark raised his wand and copied the good hook in golden light. his copy spell always lasted exactly ten spoken counts. \"that is plenty,\" he said": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/spark-raised-his-wand-and-copied-the-good-hook-in-golden-light-his-copy-spell-always-lasted-exactly-ten-spoken-counts-that-is-plenty-he-said-69851787c1.mp3",
    "spark squeezed his nose and tried to hold the sneeze inside. gold magic gathered around his watering eyes, growing brighter with every silent second": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/spark-squeezed-his-nose-and-tried-to-hold-the-sneeze-inside-gold-magic-gathered-around-his-watering-eyes-growing-brighter-with-every-silent-second-9c5e09898b.mp3",
    "spark told glimmer to push harder on the next breath. thick smoke rolled across the stone circle, making both friends cough and wave their hands": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/spark-told-glimmer-to-push-harder-on-the-next-breath-thick-smoke-rolled-across-the-stone-circle-making-both-friends-cough-and-wave-their-hands-e548ee060a.mp3",
    "spark woke with a cold and a tickle deep inside his nose. because loose wand magic followed every sneeze, golden sparks already danced around him": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/spark-woke-with-a-cold-and-a-tickle-deep-inside-his-nose-because-loose-wand-magic-followed-every-sneeze-golden-sparks-already-danced-around-him-ec356c8391.mp3",
