    "still asleep, burrow leaned against the mushroom where pip and glimmer were hiding. his loud snore shook the cap, and both watchers had to move aside": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/still-asleep-burrow-leaned-against-the-mushroom-where-pip-and-glimmer-were-hiding-his-loud-snore-shook-the-cap-and-both-watchers-had-to-move-aside-8287ae0d15.mp3",
    "stone began with the lowest root chime, and pip answered on the next. together, they followed the matching tools upward. four separate notes rang in order": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/stone-began-with-the-lowest-root-chime-and-pip-answered-on-the-next-together-they-followed-the-matching-tools-upward-four-separate-notes-rang-in-order-1d77e44087.mp3",
    "stone caught one foot on a thick root. he wobbled, stretched both arms, and slowly lowered himself until he sat on the path": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/stone-caught-one-foot-on-a-thick-root-he-wobbled-stretched-both-arms-and-slowly-lowered-himself-until-he-sat-on-the-path-65d4936d7c.mp3",
    "stone crouched beside the stream and reached toward the fish. then he pulled back. 'i want to help,' he admitted, 'but i really dislike getting wet.'": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/stone-crouched-beside-the-stream-and-reached-toward-the-fish-then-he-pulled-back-i-want-to-help-he-admitted-but-i-really-dislike-getting-wet-1353de7ddf.mp3",
    "stone gripped the thick fixed side rope with both broad hands. keeping his eyes on that steady rope, he stepped onto the bridge again": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/stone-gripped-the-thick-fixed-side-rope-with-both-broad-hands-keeping-his-eyes-on-that-steady-rope-he-stepped-onto-the-bridge-again-f4207c679e.mp3",
    "stone held the rock outside the roots and tilted it toward the garden. a bright moonbeam flashed over the buds and struck the branches. too high": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/stone-held-the-rock-outside-the-roots-and-tilted-it-toward-the-garden-a-bright-moonbeam-flashed-over-the-buds-and-struck-the-branches-too-high-1665ace121.mp3",
    "stone knelt beside the mossy rock so he would not seem so large. \"i can help with a small call,\" he told the toadling": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/stone-knelt-beside-the-mossy-rock-so-he-would-not-seem-so-large-i-can-help-with-a-small-call-he-told-the-toadling-51728852ab.mp3",
