    "when pip reached the top, his worried face opened into a grin. he climbed down safely, then carried the warm stone toward fog marsh": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/when-pip-reached-the-top-his-worried-face-opened-into-a-grin-he-climbed-down-safely-then-carried-the-warm-stone-toward-fog-marsh-a8c2d33c6c.mp3",
    "when spark called \"ten,\" the golden hook vanished without warning. the lantern dropped, but luna caught it safely. spark stared at the empty rail": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/when-spark-called-ten-the-golden-hook-vanished-without-warning-the-lantern-dropped-but-luna-caught-it-safely-spark-stared-at-the-empty-rail-b87f5501bc.mp3",
    "when spark felt one final tickle, he turned away and sneezed into fern's cloth. nothing changed, so dewdrop happily checked off every ordinary fish": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/when-spark-felt-one-final-tickle-he-turned-away-and-sneezed-into-fern-s-cloth-nothing-changed-so-dewdrop-happily-checked-off-every-ordinary-fish-9c9384b799.mp3",
    "when the final basket left, the mist spirit stretched tall and clear. fresh water moved around its tree, and the gray fog began drawing back": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/when-the-final-basket-left-the-mist-spirit-stretched-tall-and-clear-fresh-water-moved-around-its-tree-and-the-gray-fog-began-drawing-back-37f72df742.mp3",
    "when the light cleared, wren saw her tiny reflection far below the mirror. the spell had made her only one inch tall instead of taller": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/when-the-light-cleared-wren-saw-her-tiny-reflection-far-below-the-mirror-the-spell-had-made-her-only-one-inch-tall-instead-of-taller-3451d05d42.mp3",
